 "remarks": "Minutes to the beach, train, Tokeneke School, and both downtown Darien and Noroton Heights, 2 McCrea Lane sits on a cul-de-sac close to everything. Sun-filled two-story foyer, high ceilings and traditional layout. Updated kitchen with quartz counters, large center island, pantry, and sliders with private deck - the perfect spot for the grill and morning coffee. Family room with custom built ins, wood-burning fireplace, and a French door that opens to a flagstone patio. Four bedrooms, bright bonus space (or possible 5th bedroom) plus finished basement with more custom built-ins, unfinished storage area, cedar closet, and potting room with sink and counter space. Let's not forget the attached two car garage and half-acre lot with spots to sit or play. All the spaces in all the right places!",
